Package: kkstatfun
Title: R Statistical Analysis Toolkit for Medical and Epidemiology
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Kostadin", "Kostadinov", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "drkostadinkostadinov@gmail.com")
URL: https://github.com/kostadinoff/kkstatfun
BugReports: https://github.com/kostadinoff/kkstatfun/issues
Description: A comprehensive toolkit for medical statistics and epidemiology.
    Provides tidy, group-aware functions for measures of association,
    standardisation, diagnostic accuracy, agreement, survival and competing
    risks, causal inference, infectious-disease models, health-economic
    evaluation, time series, and Bulgarian EGN parsing. Every analysis
    function takes individual-level data as its first argument, honours
    dplyr::group_by(), and returns a tibble.
